              and the projection to
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi 𝒞
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
                    %mi A
                    %mo ,
                    %mi S
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \mathcal{C}(A, S)
              takes the bottom horizontal arrow.
          %h2#properties Properties
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                In a
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/topos"} topos
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                  %semantics
                    %mrow
                      %msub
                        %mi B
                        %mo ⊥
                    %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} B_\bot
                of
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                  %semantics
                    %mrow
                      %mi B
                    %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} B
                is
                = succeed "." do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/injective+object"} injective
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                  %semantics
                    %mrow
                      %mi B
                      %mo ↣
                      %msub
                        %mi B
                        %mo ⊥
                    %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} B\rightarrowtail B_\bot
                shows accordingly that a topos
                = succeed "!" do
                  %em has enough injectives
            %li
              %p
                In a topos, the
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/subobject+classifier"} subobject classifier
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                  %semantics
                    %mrow
                      %mi true
                      %mo :
                      %mn 1
                      %mo →
                      %mi Ω
                    %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} true:1\rightarrow\Omega
                coincides with the monomorphism
                = succeed "." do
                  %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                    %semantics
                      %mrow
                        %msub
                          %mi η
                          %mn 1
                        %mo :
                        %mn 1
                        %mo ↣
                        %msub
                          %mn 1
                          %mo ⊥
                      %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \eta_1:1\rightarrowtail 1_\bot
            %li
              %p
                In a topos, the assignment of
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                  %semantics
                    %mrow
                      %msub
                        %mi B
                        %mo ⊥
                    %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} B_\bot
                to
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                  %semantics
                    %mrow
                      %mi B
                    %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} B
                is functorial.
